<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title><%= judulWeb %></title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
</head>
<body class="bg-krem">
    <header>
        <div class="logo"><img src="https://github.com/dilaa62/NEEDMAP/blob/main/LOGO.png?raw=true" alt="Logo NEEDMAP" class="logo-img"></div>
        <nav><a href="/jelajahi" class="active">Jelajahi NEED</a></nav>
    </header>

    <section class="p-50 teks-hijau-tua">
        <h1 style="font-size: 2.2em; margin-bottom: 5px;">Bantu Melalui Barang</h1>
        <h3 style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 20px;">Kirimkan barang yang sedang dibutuhkan</h3>
        <p style="font-size: 1.1em; max-width: 900px;">Barang akan dikirimkan langsung ke alamat pengaju. Pastikan barang dalam kondisi layak dan sesuai dengan spesifikasi kebutuhan yang diminta.</p>

        <div class="form-dana-box mt-50 text-center">
            <h2>Rincian Barang</h2>
            <div class="input-rp-container"><input type="text" class="input-rp" placeholder="Nama Barang (contoh: Susu Bayi 1-3 Tahun)"></div>
            <div class="input-rp-container"><input type="text" class="input-rp" placeholder="Jumlah (contoh: 5 Kaleng)"></div>
            <div class="input-rp-container">
                <select class="input-rp" style="cursor: pointer;">
                    <option>Pilih Metode Pengiriman</option>
                    <option>Dikirim via Kurir / Ekspedisi</option>
                    <option>Diantar Langsung ke Lokasi Panti</option>
                </select>
            </div>
            <button class="btn-hijau mt-30" style="padding: 10px 50px; font-size: 1.1em;">Konfirmasi Pengiriman</button>
        </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="bg-krem">
        <div class="sosmed-icons">
            <img src="https://github.com/dilaa62/NEEDMAP/blob/main/yt.png?raw=true" alt="YouTube">
            <img src="https://github.com/dilaa62/NEEDMAP/blob/main/ig.png?raw=true" alt="Instagram">
            <img src="https://github.com/dilaa62/NEEDMAP/blob/main/x.png?raw=true" alt="X">
            <img src="https://github.com/dilaa62/NEEDMAP/blob/main/tiktok.png?raw=true" alt="TikTok">
        </div>
        <h3 class="teks-hijau-tua">Ikuti NEEDMAP untuk inspirasi kebaikan terbaru</h3>
        <p class="copyright">© 2026 NEEDMAP. All Rights Reserved</p>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>